petra 0

# An unstiffened seated connection, ASD: a W16x26 beam bearing on an L4x4x1/2 seat, 6 in long,
# bolted to the web of a W10x49 column with one row of two 3/4 in A325-N bolts at a 3-1/2 in
# gauge (bolt 2 in from the heel and 2 in from the toe of the vertical leg). An L4x4x1/4 top
# angle holds the beam's top flange. The 6 in seat fits the W10x49 web's 7-1/2 in flat (T).

seated seat1 {
  basis asd
  beam W16x26 grade steel.A992
  support W10x49 web grade steel.A992
  angle L4x4x1_2 grade steel.A36 outstanding short
  seat_length 6 inch
  setback 0.5 inch
  support_side bolted
  bolts bolt_group.120 diameter 0.75 inch threads included
  rows 1
  pitch 3 inch
  edge_vertical 2 inch
  support_gauge 3.5 inch
  top_angle L4x4x1_4 grade steel.A36 outstanding long
}
